OL,3,GNEWSAUK has 'no authority' over death
OL,4,Aof woman shot in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy's mother Jane Coates wrote to
OL,7,FCheshire Police urging them to "gather
OL,8,Fevidence" here locally, and then
OL,9,F"liaise" with US authorities - but the
OL,10,Fforce has responded and said it was
OL,11,F"constrained" by law and jurisdiction.
